00:20:02.562 --> 00:20:05.796
- I wouldn't leave something
like that up to chance.

00:20:05.796 --> 00:20:06.629
- I don't.

00:20:07.570 --> 00:20:08.593
I make my own luck.

00:20:09.870 --> 00:20:11.595
- [Bailiff] All rise.

00:20:11.595 --> 00:20:14.860
The honorable Judge Freel presiding.

00:20:14.860 --> 00:20:17.640
- So there often is some contention

00:20:17.640 --> 00:20:20.560
about who is going to handle cases.

00:20:20.560 --> 00:20:22.370
In a high profile case like this,

00:20:22.370 --> 00:20:27.240
almost always the senior
attorney would handle it.

00:20:27.240 --> 00:20:31.530
And so it's unlikely
that a junior prosecutor

00:20:31.530 --> 00:20:33.410
or district attorney would get to handle

00:20:33.410 --> 00:20:35.260
such a high profile case in this case.

00:20:35.260 --> 00:20:38.380
However, if the DA didn't show up,

00:20:38.380 --> 00:20:43.071
then the junior deputy would
probably have to handle it.

00:20:43.071 --> 00:20:44.730
- I thought the DA just played golf

