00:20:49.780 --> 00:20:52.070
- Sometimes the head DA is not

00:20:52.070 --> 00:20:54.270
the best person to try a case.

00:20:54.270 --> 00:20:56.200
Sometimes they're just a political head

00:20:56.200 --> 00:20:57.910
who run the department rather

00:20:57.910 --> 00:20:59.940
than actually conduct the trials.

00:20:59.940 --> 00:21:00.960
- In Arkham, someone must have

00:21:00.960 --> 00:21:02.910
