00:21:08.150 --> 00:21:10.190
Could you identify him for us, please?

00:21:10.190 --> 00:21:11.363
- You win, counselor.

00:21:13.740 --> 00:21:14.723
It was me.

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:19.700
- I have a sworn statement from you

00:21:19.700 --> 00:21:22.480
that this man, Salvatore Maroni,

00:21:22.480 --> 00:21:24.430
is the new head of the
Falcone crime family.

00:21:24.430 --> 00:21:25.263
- [Witness] Maroni?

00:21:25.263 --> 00:21:26.740
- In the criminal world,

00:21:26.740 --> 00:21:28.740
there aren't depositions beforehand.

00:21:28.740 --> 00:21:30.840
However, the police may take a statement

00:21:30.840 --> 00:21:33.690
or the DA may take a
statement from a witness.

00:21:33.690 --> 00:21:36.800
And you can use that statement to impeach

00:21:36.800 --> 00:21:39.440
the testimony of the witness on the stand.

00:21:39.440 --> 00:21:41.910
In the civil world, there are very likely

00:21:41.910 --> 00:21:43.540
to be depositions, which means that

00:21:43.540 --> 00:21:45.580
you will ask questions and answers.

00:21:45.580 --> 00:21:48.070
And if the witness deviates from

00:21:48.070 --> 00:21:50.370
what was in their deposition,
then you are allowed

00:21:50.370 --> 00:21:54.810
to bring that up to the
trier of fact and show that

00:21:54.810 --> 00:21:58.070
they cannot be trusted,
that they break their word.

00:21:58.070 --> 00:22:00.240
And that's sort of what is going on

00:22:00.240 --> 00:22:02.020
with the statement that
I have a sworn statement.

00:22:02.020 --> 00:22:03.600
I mean, you're not allowed to literally

00:22:03.600 --> 00:22:05.390
just hold up a sworn statement.

00:22:05.390 --> 00:22:07.400
You are allowed to enter it into evidence

00:22:07.400 --> 00:22:09.180
and to question the witness about it.

00:22:09.180 --> 00:22:13.400
But they're taking some liberties here.

00:22:13.400 --> 00:22:14.440
- Maroni?

00:22:14.440 --> 00:22:15.720
He's a fall guy.

00:22:15.720 --> 00:22:17.767
I'm the brains of the organization.

00:22:17.767 --> 00:22:18.600
(court room laughing)

00:22:18.600 --> 00:22:19.620
- [Judge] Order.

00:22:19.620 --> 00:22:20.860
- Permission to treat
