00:22:35.220 --> 00:22:38.640
The next scene comes from Erin Brockovich.

00:22:38.640 --> 00:22:40.177
- Let's be honest here.

00:22:40.177 --> 00:22:42.070
$20 million is more money than

00:22:42.070 --> 00:22:43.770
these people have ever dreamed of.

00:22:45.050 --> 00:22:47.680
- Oh see, now that pisses me off.

00:22:47.680 --> 00:22:49.350
