00:22:54.614 --> 00:22:57.380
- So that's interesting legal jargon.

00:22:57.380 --> 00:22:58.570
It's actually fairly accurate.

00:22:58.570 --> 00:23:01.286
This seems like a settlement discussion

00:23:01.286 --> 00:23:04.430
between the defense and the prosecution.

00:23:04.430 --> 00:23:07.310
And what Julia Roberts has said there

00:23:07.310 --> 00:23:10.350
is that after the demurrer,
they've gotten more plaintiffs.

00:23:10.350 --> 00:23:13.160
Which a demurrer is like
a motion to dismiss.

00:23:13.160 --> 00:23:16.653
The defendants tried to
dismiss the case out of hand,

00:23:17.570 --> 00:23:19.130
but they obviously lost.

00:23:19.130 --> 00:23:23.060
And since that time, the defense side

00:23:23.060 --> 00:23:25.660
has found even more plaintiffs.

00:23:25.660 --> 00:23:28.090
This is a class action lawsuit.

00:23:28.090 --> 00:23:31.100
So the more plaintiffs and
the more injured parties,

00:23:31.100 --> 00:23:36.100
potentially the more
recovery may be on the table.

00:23:36.720 --> 00:23:41.193
But by the same token, the
more members of a class,

00:23:43.309 --> 00:23:45.740
the less money every individual plaintiff

00:23:45.740 --> 00:23:47.380
is going to get if you
have to take the pie

00:23:47.380 --> 00:23:50.125
and spread it up into more payments.

00:23:50.125 --> 00:23:52.790
Then they're not likely
to get nearly as much.

00:23:52.790 --> 00:23:56.160
So $20 million may sound like
a lot, but if it's spread out

00:23:56.160 --> 00:23:58.230
amongst hundreds or thousands of people,

00:23:58.230 --> 00:24:01.370
which is what Julia Roberts
is saying is happening,

00:24:01.370 --> 00:24:03.160
they may not get very much

00:24:03.160 --> 00:24:05.350
personally into their own pockets.

00:24:05.350 --> 00:24:07.180
- They may not be the
most sophisticated people,

00:24:07.180 --> 00:24:08.640
but they do know how to divide

00:24:08.640 --> 00:24:11.897
and $20 million isn't shit
when you split it between them.

00:24:11.897 --> 00:24:12.730
- Erin.

