00:29:45.760 --> 00:29:46.910
I'm really quite tired.

00:29:50.466 --> 00:29:51.500
Woo.

00:29:51.500 --> 00:29:54.410
- So those are some of
my favorite legal movies.

00:29:54.410 --> 00:29:56.140
Some are more realistic than others,

00:29:56.140 --> 00:29:57.960
but it's always fun to see how Hollywood

00:29:57.960 --> 00:29:59.990
thinks lawyers react in real life.

